+### Parameters
+*   $\lambda_{img} = 0.001$ [S1]
+*   $\lambda_{nc} = 0.1$ [S1]
+*   $\lambda_{min} = 0.1$ [S1]
+*   $\lambda_{max} = 10$ [S1]
+*   $\lambda_{proj} = 50$ [S1]
